# Copy to .dev.vars for local dev (gitignored). In production use `wrangler secret put`.
ADMIN_TOKEN=change-me

# Artificial Analysis — powers `aa-intelligence-index` (Frontier & benchmarks).
# Free key, request one at https://artificialanalysis.ai/insights/api
# (docs: https://artificialanalysis.ai/documentation). Sent as an `x-api-key`
# header. Without it the instrument is skipped and every other card still works.
# ARTIFICIAL_ANALYSIS_API_KEY=

# Not wired up yet — see "Candidates / next" in docs/INSTRUMENTS.md.
# Lambda Labs cloud API key, a keyed cross-check on the Vast.ai spot price.
# Generate at https://cloud.lambdalabs.com/api-keys
# LAMBDA_API_KEY=
